      "id": 1,
      "text": "In naming the town, 'Grove' was chosen from Swede Grove, and 'City' represented the citizens' hope for the town's future.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
